# Read by Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify). Vite copies this file into dist/.
# The game lives at /play, but there is no file of that name: it is the same index.html, which
# reads the address and shows the game (src/app/route.ts). These rules answer a direct visit,
# a bookmark or a reload of /play with index.html, keeping /play in the address bar (200, not
# a redirect). The landing page at / is index.html already.
/play     /index.html   200
/play/    /index.html   200
